<title>JAPAN: Nomura Sec 9-mth current profit up 69.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Nomura Sec 9-mth current profit up 69.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd said on Thursday that it posted a parent current profit of 103.69 billion yen in the nine months to December 31, 1996, up 69.3 percent from the same period a year earlier.  </p>
<p>Nine months to December 31 compared with a year earlier:</p>
<p> (parent)     (in billions of yen)</p>
<p> Revenues	   363.55	     vs	  314.38</p>
<p> Operating	  104.70	     vs	   60.51</p>
<p> Current	    103.69	     vs	   61.26</p>
</text>
